WEBVTT

00:00.652 --> 00:03.652
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:03.652 --> 00:11.819
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:11.819 --> 00:14.719
- * Founder's Day
is here today. *
- * 创始人日
今天就在这里。 *

00:14.719 --> 00:15.919
Squidward, is this even?
章鱼哥，这还算平吗？

00:15.919 --> 00:18.252
- A little higher.
- 高一点。

00:18.252 --> 00:19.585
A little to the left.
向左一点。

00:19.585 --> 00:21.919
A little more to the left.
再往左边一点。

00:21.919 --> 00:24.819
Ha!
Perfect.
哈!
完美的。

00:28.685 --> 00:29.952
Oh.
哦。

00:29.952 --> 00:33.152
- [humming wildly]
- [疯狂哼唱]

00:33.152 --> 00:35.252
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:35.252 --> 00:38.485
- Whoa, Mr. Krabs
really loves Founder's Day.
- 哇哦，蟹老板
真的很喜欢创始人日。

00:38.485 --> 00:39.719
- No, he doesn't.
- 不，他没有。

00:39.719 --> 00:41.285
- But just look at him go.
- 但只要看着他就走。

00:41.285 --> 00:43.285
- This is the day
he gets the patty orders
- 这一天
他得到了肉饼的订单

00:43.285 --> 00:46.085
for the big Founder's Day
eating contest.
庆祝伟大的创始人日
饮食比赛。

00:46.085 --> 00:48.519
It's the most money
Krabs makes all year.
这是最多的钱
螃蟹全年都在生产。

00:48.519 --> 00:49.985
- Oh, but it's not just that.
- 哦，但不仅仅是这样。

00:49.985 --> 00:52.885
Mr. Krabs has a lot of love
in his heart for this town.
蟹老板有很多爱
他心里对这个小镇。

00:52.885 --> 00:54.152
- Nope, Squidward's right.
- 不，章鱼哥是对的。

00:54.152 --> 00:56.919
Not only do I supply
the eating contest,
我不仅供应
饮食大赛，

00:56.919 --> 00:58.919
but I get to sell
me profit-laden patties
但我可以卖掉
我的利润丰厚的馅饼

00:58.919 --> 01:01.819
to all the hungry spectators.
致所有饥饿的观众。

01:01.819 --> 01:05.719
I had to grease a few wheels,
but it was worth it.
我得给几个轮子涂润滑油
但这是值得的。

01:05.719 --> 01:06.885
- Thanks, Krabs!
- 谢谢，蟹蟹！

01:06.885 --> 01:08.552
- Sure thing,
Mr. Commissioner.
- 当然可以，
专员先生。

01:08.552 --> 01:10.252
See you at Founder's Day.
创始人日见。

01:10.252 --> 01:11.852
[coughs]
[咳嗽]

01:11.852 --> 01:15.719
* Oh, I wonder, wonder, wonder
how many patties must we make *
*哦，我想知道，想知道，想知道
我们必须做多少个肉饼 *

01:15.719 --> 01:16.952
- Wonder no longer.
- 不再好奇了。

01:16.952 --> 01:19.652
You only need one.
你只需要一个。

01:19.652 --> 01:20.919
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

01:23.552 --> 01:26.319
What do you mean "one"?
你说的“一”是什么意思？

01:26.319 --> 01:29.252
- Didn't you see
today's newspaper?
- 你没看到吗
今天的报纸？

01:29.252 --> 01:31.585
- "No Takers
for McNulty Challenge."
- “没有接受者
麦克纳尔蒂挑战赛。”

01:31.585 --> 01:34.119
Ha! What is that
supposed to mean?
哈!那是什么
应该是什么意思？

01:34.119 --> 01:35.719
- He's the current champion.
- 他是目前的冠军。

01:35.719 --> 01:38.285
He only needs to eat
one patty to win.
他只需要吃饭
一块肉饼就赢了。

01:38.285 --> 01:39.952
- [gasps]
I'm ruined.
- [喘气]
我毁了。

01:39.952 --> 01:43.552
No one wants to see
a one-patty eating contest,
没有人愿意看到
一场吃肉饼比赛，

01:43.552 --> 01:45.619
least of all me wallet.
最重要的是我的钱包。

01:45.619 --> 01:46.852
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

01:46.852 --> 01:49.319
- Hey, at least we have
Founder's Day.
- 嘿，至少我们有
创始人日。

01:49.319 --> 01:52.419
- I couldn't give a sea fig
for Founder's Day.
- 我不能给海无花果
创始人日。

01:52.419 --> 01:54.585
I need sales, boy.
我需要销售，小伙子。

01:54.585 --> 01:56.352
Sales is what I need.
销售是我所需要的。

01:56.352 --> 01:58.885
Oh, if only there was someone
dumb and hungry enough
噢，要是有人就好了
又蠢又饿

01:58.885 --> 02:00.819
to take on
old Oswald McNulty.
承担
老奥斯瓦尔德·麦克纳尔蒂。

02:00.819 --> 02:04.252
- I'll just have
47 Krabby Patties, please.
- 我只要
请给我 47 个蟹黄饼。

02:04.252 --> 02:07.252
I had a big breakfast
so I'm not that hungry.
我吃了一顿丰盛的早餐
所以我没那么饿。

02:07.252 --> 02:09.619
Squidward, did you get
a new haircut?
章鱼哥，你得到了吗？
新发型？

02:09.619 --> 02:11.819
- Ah, dumb and hungry.
- 啊，又蠢又饿。

02:11.819 --> 02:14.819
Well, if it isn't Patrick.
好吧，如果不是帕特里克的话。

02:14.819 --> 02:16.519
- I isn't Patrick?
- 我不是帕特里克？

02:16.519 --> 02:17.652
- No, no, of course you ares.
- 不，不，你当然是。

02:17.652 --> 02:19.585
How would you like to eat
你想吃什么

02:19.585 --> 02:22.519
as many Krabby Patties
as you can handle
和蟹肉饼一样多
你可以处理的

02:22.519 --> 02:26.852
and restore the honor
of your hometown?
并恢复荣誉
你家乡的？

02:26.852 --> 02:28.085
- I like the first part,
- 我喜欢第一部分，

02:28.085 --> 02:30.119
but I don't understand
the second part.
但我不明白
第二部分。

02:30.119 --> 02:32.685
- I'm talking
about Oswald McNulty.
- 我在说话
关于奥斯瓦尔德·麦克纳尔蒂。

02:32.685 --> 02:36.319
He comes here every year
with his big-city ways
他每年都会来这里
以他的大城市风格

02:36.319 --> 02:38.619
and his extremely relaxed
throat muscles,
和他极其放松的
喉咙肌肉，

02:38.619 --> 02:41.919
and he shows us up
like a bunch of rubes.
他向我们展示了
像一群乡巴佬。

02:41.919 --> 02:43.285
Rubes!
鲁布斯！

02:43.285 --> 02:45.619
And on Founder's Day,
no less.
在创始人日那天，
不少。

02:45.619 --> 02:47.685
[bell dinging]
[铃声]

02:47.685 --> 02:51.985
We need a hometown hero
to make me lots of money.
我们需要一位家乡英雄
让我赚很多钱。

02:51.985 --> 02:55.819
I mean, return the belt
to Bikini Bottom.
我的意思是，把腰带还给我
到比基尼底部。

02:55.819 --> 02:58.819
[chuckles nervously]
[紧张地笑]

02:58.819 --> 02:59.885
You're going up
against the best,
你要往上走
对抗最优秀的人，

02:59.885 --> 03:01.419
so you have to be the best.
所以你必须是最好的。

03:01.419 --> 03:04.285
We're going to light a fire
under you, boy-o.
我们要生火
在你之下，小伙子。

03:04.285 --> 03:06.319
- Oh, no,
that's going to hurt!
- 哦，不，
那会很痛！

03:06.319 --> 03:08.952
- Listen up, mister.
No more fooling around.
- 听着，先生。
别再胡闹了。

03:08.952 --> 03:12.485
You're here to eat and eat
你来这里是为了吃吃吃

03:12.485 --> 03:14.885
and then eat some more.
然后再吃一些。

03:14.885 --> 03:16.452
- I like to eat.
- 我喜欢吃。

03:16.452 --> 03:19.819
- Well, let's see how your tummy
handles these patties,
- 好吧，让我们看看你的肚子怎么样
处理这些肉饼，

03:19.819 --> 03:21.685
Mr. Likes To Eat.
先生喜欢吃。

03:21.685 --> 03:24.519
- [laughs]
You said "tummy."
- [笑]
你说的是“肚子”。

03:24.519 --> 03:25.519
- Tummy!
- 肚子！

03:25.519 --> 03:28.452
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:28.452 --> 03:29.852
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

03:29.852 --> 03:31.552
- I like whistles!
- 我喜欢口哨！

03:31.552 --> 03:33.685
- Eat!
- 吃！

03:33.685 --> 03:34.685
- Oh.
- 哦。

03:34.685 --> 03:37.119
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

03:41.552 --> 03:45.019
- What are you doing?
You're wasting time.
- 你在干什么？
你在浪费时间。

03:45.019 --> 03:48.852
- Got to warm up
my taste buds first.
- 必须热身
首先是我的味蕾。

03:48.852 --> 03:52.819
[cheering]
[欢呼]

03:52.819 --> 03:55.819
- Son,
can you eat faster?
- 儿子，
你能吃快点吗？

03:55.819 --> 03:57.985
- Oh, faster.
- 哦，快点。

04:03.385 --> 04:05.285
- Four and a half patties
in one minute?
- 四个半肉饼
一分钟内？

04:05.285 --> 04:07.252
Why, McNulty can eat
100 in a minute.
为什么，麦克纳尔蒂可以吃东西
一分钟100。

04:07.252 --> 04:08.585
But, you know,
I think your teeth
但是，你知道，
我觉得你的牙齿

04:08.585 --> 04:10.485
might be getting in the way
a little bit there.
可能会妨碍
那里有一点点。

04:10.485 --> 04:13.419
- Oh,
why didn't you say so?
- 哦，
你为什么不这么说？

04:13.419 --> 04:15.319
- Ooh, I didn't know
you had false teeth.
- 哦，我不知道
你有假牙。

04:15.319 --> 04:18.619
- [laughs]
I don't.
- [笑]
我不知道。

04:18.619 --> 04:19.852
- Nah, that can't be it.
- 不，不可能是这样。

04:19.852 --> 04:21.085
McNulty has teeth.
麦克纳尔蒂有牙齿。

04:21.085 --> 04:23.285
SpongeBob,
let's go to the film.
海绵宝宝，
我们去看电影吧。

04:23.285 --> 04:25.819
Look at that devious face,
看看那张阴险的脸，

04:25.819 --> 04:28.352
a face without pity--
一张没有怜悯的脸——

04:28.352 --> 04:31.819
cold, dead eyes,
like a shark's eyes.
冰冷、死气沉沉的眼神，
像鲨鱼的眼睛。

04:31.819 --> 04:36.819
What is Oswald McNulty doing
that Patrick Star is not?
奥斯瓦尔德·麦克纳尔蒂在做什么
那帕特里克星不是吗？

04:36.819 --> 04:38.419
- His homework?
- [gasps]
- 他的作业？
- [喘气]

04:38.419 --> 04:40.252
Or maybe we should be asking,
或者也许我们应该问，

04:40.252 --> 04:43.852
what is Oswald McNulty
not doing?
奥斯瓦尔德·麦克纳尔蒂是什么
不做什么？

04:43.852 --> 04:45.219
- His taxes?
- 他的税？

04:45.219 --> 04:46.719
- You're both wrong!
Or possibly right.
- 你们都错了！
或者可能是对的。

04:46.719 --> 04:49.085
I mean, I don't know much
about his personal life.
我的意思是，我知道的不多
关于他的个人生活。

04:49.085 --> 04:51.552
The point is,
he's not tasting, boys.
重点是，
他没有品尝，孩子们。

04:51.552 --> 04:53.819
That's where
Oswald McNulty has the edge.
那就是那里
奥斯瓦尔德·麦克纳尔蒂有优势。

04:53.819 --> 04:56.552
Those extra seconds you take
to taste the patty, Patrick,
你多花的那几秒
品尝肉饼，帕特里克，

04:56.552 --> 04:58.085
are slowing you down.
正在减慢你的速度。

04:58.085 --> 05:02.052
From now on, you must pop them
in your mouth and swallow.
从现在开始，你必须弹出它们
放入口中并吞咽。

05:02.052 --> 05:03.519
- I don't get to taste?
- 我没机会尝尝？

05:03.519 --> 05:05.385
- This feels wrong,
Mr. Krabs.
- 这感觉不对，
蟹老板。

05:05.385 --> 05:07.085
- Stow that bilge water,
bucket boy.
- 存放舱底水，
水桶男孩。

05:07.085 --> 05:08.319
We're going to need
100 more patties.
我们将需要
还有100个肉饼。

05:08.319 --> 05:11.552
- Okay, I'll get
right on it.
- 好的，我会得到
就在上面。

05:11.552 --> 05:14.819
- We're going to teach
this sea star a new way to eat--
- 我们要教书
这种海星的新吃法——

05:14.819 --> 05:16.652
without tasting.
无需品尝。

05:16.652 --> 05:19.952
all: No!
全体：不！

05:19.952 --> 05:23.052
[inspiring music]
[鼓舞人心的音乐]

05:23.052 --> 05:31.019
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:31.019 --> 05:34.052
[growls]
[咆哮]

05:34.052 --> 05:38.819
Oh!
[munching wildly]
哦！
[疯狂地咀嚼]

05:38.819 --> 05:41.519
- There he goes!
- Our champion!
- 他走了！
- 我们的冠军！

05:43.719 --> 05:45.352
- He's so dreamy!
- 他真是太有梦想了！

05:45.352 --> 05:47.985
- Oh!
- 哦！

05:47.985 --> 05:49.885
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

05:49.885 --> 05:50.885
- Come one, come all.
- 一个都来，大家都来。

05:50.885 --> 05:52.485
This Sunday, Sunday, Sunday.
这周日，周日，周日。

05:52.485 --> 05:55.385
It's a Founder's Day
eating extravaganza.
今天是创始人日
饮食盛宴。

05:55.385 --> 05:57.552
Watch your hometown hero,
Patrick Star,
关注家乡的英雄，
帕特里克·斯塔,

05:57.552 --> 05:59.952
take on the malevolent mouth
from three towns over,
恶毒的嘴
来自三个以上的城镇，

05:59.952 --> 06:02.052
Oswald McNulty
奥斯瓦尔德·麦克纳尔蒂

06:02.052 --> 06:05.019
and see who takes
the Patty Belt.
看看谁拿走
帕蒂腰带。

06:05.019 --> 06:07.552
- Say, can my little boy
ask you something?
- 说，我的小男孩可以吗？
问你什么事吗？

06:07.552 --> 06:08.819
- [muffled speech]
- [低声说话]

06:08.819 --> 06:11.152
- Are you the brave man
that's going
- 你是勇敢的人吗
就这样

06:11.152 --> 06:14.885
to bring the belt back
to Bikini Bottom?
把皮带带回来
到比基尼底部？

06:14.885 --> 06:19.152
- [muffled speech]
- [低声说话]

06:19.152 --> 06:21.619
- Inspiring words.
- 鼓舞人心的话语。

06:21.619 --> 06:24.852
- I "hurted" my foot
on the playground.
- 我的脚“受伤了”
在操场上。

06:24.852 --> 06:27.285
- Yeah, yeah, that's wonderful.
Move back.
- 是的，是的，那太棒了。
向后移动。

06:27.285 --> 06:30.052
Be sure to bring
your friends.
一定要带
你的朋友们。

06:30.052 --> 06:31.919
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

06:31.919 --> 06:33.552
[crowd booing]
[人群嘘声]

06:33.552 --> 06:36.885
- Dad, is that the bad man
who took the belt away
- 爸爸，那是坏人吗
谁拿走了腰带

06:36.885 --> 06:38.052
from Bikini Bottom?
来自比基尼底部？

06:38.052 --> 06:39.719
- Yes, it is, son.
Boo!
- 是的，是的，儿子。
嘘！

06:39.719 --> 06:40.952
- Boo!
- 嘘！

06:40.952 --> 06:43.085
- It looks like this crowd
is hungry...
- 看起来就像这群人
饿了……

06:43.085 --> 06:45.019
for excitement, that is,
为了兴奋，也就是说

06:45.019 --> 06:46.352
and also possibly food.
也可能是食物。

06:46.352 --> 06:48.352
Any moment now,
these doors will open
现在任何时刻，
这些门将会打开

06:48.352 --> 06:51.319
on what promises to be the most
dynamic patty-eating contest
关于什么是最有希望的
动态吃馅饼比赛

06:51.319 --> 06:53.819
in Founder's Day history.
在创始人日的历史上。

06:53.819 --> 06:57.185
- Krabby Patties,
T-shirts, conical hats,
- 蟹黄饼，
T恤、圆锥形帽子、

06:57.185 --> 07:00.085
and Patrick's choppers.
和帕特里克的直升机。

07:00.085 --> 07:01.619
- Today our local hero,
Patrick Star,
- 今天我们当地的英雄，
帕特里克·斯塔,

07:01.619 --> 07:03.385
the courageous underdog,
is going up
勇敢的失败者，
正在上升

07:03.385 --> 07:05.819
against five-time belt winner
Oswald McNulty,
对阵五冠王
奥斯瓦尔德·麦克纳尔蒂,

07:05.819 --> 07:07.085
from three towns over.
来自三个城镇以上。

07:07.085 --> 07:08.319
One can only imagine
the seething tension
人们只能想象
沸腾的紧张

07:08.319 --> 07:09.519
boiling over right now
现在沸腾了

07:09.519 --> 07:11.185
between these two titans
of the sport
在这两个泰坦之间
这项运动的

07:11.185 --> 07:13.485
as they prepare
for ultimate battle.
当他们准备时
为了最终的战斗。

07:13.485 --> 07:15.819
[insects chirping]
- Hey.
[昆虫鸣叫]
- 嘿。

07:15.819 --> 07:17.519
- How's it going?
- 怎么样了？

07:19.685 --> 07:23.419
- Five short minutes to consume
as many patties as they can.
- 短短五分钟即可食用
尽可能多的肉饼。

07:23.419 --> 07:25.019
- Who's ready?
- 谁准备好了？

07:25.019 --> 07:27.252
- SpongeBob,
I don't want to do this.
- 海绵宝宝，
我不想这样做。

07:27.252 --> 07:28.419
- Well, then don't do it.
- 好吧，那就别这么做了。

07:28.419 --> 07:30.052
I'm sure Mr. Krabs
will understand.
我确信蟹老板
会明白的。

07:30.052 --> 07:32.385
- [sniffs]
I smell mutiny.
- [嗅嗅]
我闻到了叛变的味道。

07:32.385 --> 07:34.152
What's going on here?
这是怎么回事？

07:34.152 --> 07:36.285
- I don't want to eat
in the contest.
- 我不想吃饭
在比赛中。

07:36.285 --> 07:38.019
It hurts my taste feelings.
它伤害了我的味觉感受。

07:38.019 --> 07:41.152
[all sobbing]
[全都抽泣]

07:41.152 --> 07:44.585
- Hmm.
No problem.
- 唔。
没问题。

07:44.585 --> 07:46.252
Here.
- What's that?
这里。
- 那是什么？

07:46.252 --> 07:49.952
- That is a bill for all
the Krabby Patties you ate
- 这是所有人的账单
你吃的蟹黄饼

07:49.952 --> 07:51.685
during training.
训练期间。

07:54.252 --> 07:56.385
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

07:56.385 --> 07:59.485
- But I didn't know
I had to pay.
- 但我不知道
我必须付钱。

07:59.485 --> 08:01.019
- Well, I didn't know either
- 嗯，我也不知道

08:01.019 --> 08:03.685
until you decided
you weren't doing the contest,
直到你决定
你没有参加比赛

08:03.685 --> 08:06.719
and that means
all your "training" patties
这意味着
你所有的“训练”馅饼

08:06.719 --> 08:10.119
just became plain
eatin' patties.
刚刚变得平淡
吃肉饼。

08:10.119 --> 08:13.085
Now, if you was
to do the contest,
现在，如果你是
参加比赛，

08:13.085 --> 08:17.285
I might be inclined to tear up
this here little bill,
我可能会想流泪
这张小账单，

08:17.285 --> 08:20.052
and, of course, there are
all the people
当然，还有
所有人

08:20.052 --> 08:22.019
that are counting
on you, son.
正在计数的
在你身上，儿子。

08:22.019 --> 08:26.252
[all cheering]
- Ow, my foot.
[大家欢呼]
- 噢，我的脚。

08:26.252 --> 08:30.419
- Okay, I'll do it for the
little boy with the hurt foot.
- 好的，我会做的
脚受伤的小男孩。

08:30.419 --> 08:32.185
- You made
the right choice, kid.
- 你做了
正确的选择，孩子。

08:32.185 --> 08:33.752
[laughs]
[笑]

08:33.752 --> 08:37.952
- There's the bell.
And we're off and eating.
- 铃响了。
我们就出发去吃饭了。

08:37.952 --> 08:39.252
McNulty taking an early lead
麦克纳尔蒂早早取得领先

08:39.252 --> 08:40.952
and really going to work
on those patties.
并真正去上班
在那些肉饼上。

08:40.952 --> 08:42.285
What a dynamo!
多么强大的发电机啊！

08:42.285 --> 08:43.952
The little smelt
from three towns over
小的闻到了
来自三个以上的城镇

08:43.952 --> 08:45.452
eating at a terrific pace.
吃东西的速度非常快。

08:45.452 --> 08:47.952
But what's this?
Patrick Star isn't moving.
但这是什么？
帕特里克·斯塔没有动。

08:47.952 --> 08:49.352
He seems stuck at the gate.
他似乎被困在门口了。

08:49.352 --> 08:50.785
- What are you doing,
Patrick?
- 你在做什么，
帕特里克？

08:50.785 --> 08:53.352
Don't make me charge you
for those patties too!
别让我向你收费
还有那些馅饼！

08:53.352 --> 08:54.652
- McNulty's pressing forward.
- 麦克纳尔蒂正在向前推进。

08:54.652 --> 08:56.319
Looks like this
is going to be a blowout.
看起来像这样
将会是井喷。

08:56.319 --> 09:00.219
- Patrick,
I believe in you, Patrick.
- 帕特里克，
我相信你，帕特里克。

09:02.752 --> 09:04.619
- But wait!
Patrick Star is on the move,
- 但是等等！
帕特里克·斯塔正在行动，

09:04.619 --> 09:06.252
and patties are
starting to disappear.
和肉饼是
开始消失。

09:06.252 --> 09:08.019
Look at that
little sea star eat!
看看那个
小海星吃饭啦！

09:08.019 --> 09:09.419
He's inching closer to McNulty,
他离麦克纳尔蒂越来越近了

09:09.419 --> 09:11.252
and it looks like McNulty
can feel the heat.
它看起来像麦克纳尔蒂
可以感受到热量。

09:11.252 --> 09:13.285
Never has there been
a more prodigious display
从来没有过
更精彩的展示

09:13.285 --> 09:14.819
of competitive eating.
竞争性饮食。

09:14.819 --> 09:17.085
The amount of patties
being consumed is astounding.
肉饼的份量
被消耗的程度是惊人的。

09:17.085 --> 09:18.919
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

09:22.219 --> 09:24.452
And now, yes, yes,
现在，是的，是的，

09:24.452 --> 09:26.919
Patrick Star has matched
Oswald McNulty,
帕特里克·明星 已匹配
奥斯瓦尔德·麦克纳尔蒂,

09:26.919 --> 09:29.919
and they are tied as they
come into the homestretch.
他们被绑在一起
进入最后冲刺阶段。

09:29.919 --> 09:31.152
Both eaters are now so full,
两个食客现在都吃饱了，

09:31.152 --> 09:33.019
they can barely eat,
but eat they do.
他们几乎无法进食，
但他们确实吃。

09:33.019 --> 09:35.185
Moving so slowly now,
one can't help but wonder
现在动作这么慢，
人们不禁想知道

09:35.185 --> 09:38.652
if they are going to hit the
patty wall at some point,
如果他们要击中
帕蒂墙在某个时刻，

09:38.652 --> 09:40.119
and--and...
还有——还有……

09:40.119 --> 09:41.819
both eaters have stopped!
两个吃东西的人都停下来了！

09:41.819 --> 09:43.952
With only seconds left,
we are tied in patties eaten,
只剩下几秒钟的时间，
我们被绑在吃的肉饼上，

09:43.952 --> 09:46.352
and neither one seems
to have the room to go on.
似乎没有人
有空间继续下去。

09:46.352 --> 09:49.452
Oh!
What's this?
哦！
这是什么？

09:49.452 --> 09:52.652
And down goes McNulty!
Down goes McNulty!
麦克纳尔蒂倒下了！
麦克纳尔蒂倒下了！

09:52.652 --> 09:55.319
It looks like
we could have a tie.
看起来像
我们可以打平手。

09:55.319 --> 09:58.352
- It's over, SpongeBob.
I can't go on.
- 结束了，海绵宝宝。
我无法继续下去了。

09:58.352 --> 10:01.852
- The taste, Patrick.
Remember the taste.
- 味道，帕特里克。
记住味道。

10:01.852 --> 10:03.285
- The... taste.
- 味道。

10:03.285 --> 10:04.552
- What's this?
- 这是什么？

10:04.552 --> 10:06.252
Patrick Star has risen
from his seat
帕特里克之星已经升起
从他的座位上

10:06.252 --> 10:07.985
and is pointing
to center field.
并指着
到中场。

10:07.985 --> 10:12.819
No, wait. He's pointing to
"widdle" boy with a hurt foot.
不，等等。他指着
脚受伤的“中间”男孩。

10:12.819 --> 10:14.452
Ladies and gentlemen,
he's pointing to his mouth
女士们、先生们，
他指着他的嘴

10:14.452 --> 10:15.952
as if to indicate something.
仿佛在暗示着什么。

10:15.952 --> 10:19.185
- Here you go, champ.
You can have mine.
- 给你，冠军。
你可以拥有我的。

10:19.185 --> 10:22.819
[taste buds cheering]
[味蕾欢呼]

10:22.819 --> 10:25.719
- And he's eating.
He's eating!
- 他正在吃东西。
他正在吃东西！

10:25.719 --> 10:29.019
The Great Starbino
is eating!
伟大的斯塔比诺
正在吃饭！

10:29.019 --> 10:31.452
Patrick Star wins!
帕特里克星获胜！

10:31.452 --> 10:34.585
The belt is back
in Bikini Bottom!
腰带又回来了
在比基尼底部！

10:34.585 --> 10:37.685
The belt is back
in Bikini Bottom!
腰带又回来了
在比基尼底部！

10:37.685 --> 10:41.319
- Here you go, son.
You earned it fat and square.
- 给你，儿子。
你赢得了它又肥又方。

10:41.319 --> 10:43.152
- Yay!
- 耶！

10:43.152 --> 10:44.685
- Congratulations,
Starbino.
- 恭喜，
斯塔比诺。

10:44.685 --> 10:47.285
So are you going to defend
the belt next year?
那么你要捍卫吗
明年的腰带？

10:47.285 --> 10:51.152
- No, this thing
doesn't even fit.
- 不，这个东西
甚至不适合。

10:51.152 --> 10:54.419
- Ow!
My other foot.
- 噢！
我的另一只脚。

- 噢！
我的另一只脚。